Animal Welfare
Scope & Core Inquiries: How ethically does this organization treat animals across its research, product testing, agricultural supply chains, and commercial operations? Does it perform or finance painful animal testing for cosmetics, household cleaners, or pharmaceuticals when validated cruelty-free alternatives are available? In food production, retail, and apparel, does it enforce humane treatment benchmarks or support extreme confinement (battery cages, gestation crates), mutilations without anesthesia, and industrial factory farming? Does it source from fur farms, live-plucking operations, or destructive fishing practices that deplete marine biodiversity? Does it operate or sponsor entertainment facilities involving captive wild animals?